{"results":[{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/the-wadhwa-aquaria-grande/3009/project","title":"The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Borivali West, Mumbai | 3 & 4 BHK flats Price List & RERA Details","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![The Wadhwa Group developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/the-wadhwa-group-608.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nThe Wadhwa Aquaria Grande is located in Borivali West, Mumbai, offering thoughtfully designed 3, 4 BHK Flats. Developed by The Wadhwa Group, the property is priced from ₹ 3.55 Cr up to ₹ 4.98 Cr. This development provides a range of 3, 4 BHK to suit different family sizes and preferences. With 17 residential units, it offers a vibrant community living experience. The location boasts a connectivity index of 4.1, ensuring easy access to key destinations. Residents can enjoy a modern lifestyle with Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Lift, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Sauna, Party Hall, Normal Park / Central Green. The project's RERA number is P51800007959.\n\n![The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-wadhwa-aquaria-grande-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-wadhwa-aquaria-grande-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-wadhwa-aquaria-grande-project-apartment-interiors1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-wadhwa-aquaria-grande-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹3.55 Cr - 4.98 Cr**\n\n₹58,773 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande?\n\n## About The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande, Borivali West by The Wadhwa Group\n\nThe Wadhwa Aquaria Grande is a premium residential development by The Wadhwa Group located in Borivali West, Mumbai, offering spacious 3, 4 BHK crafted for luxury urban living. Featuring thoughtfully designed residences ranging from 1638 Sq.Ft. to 2297 Sq.Ft., the project combines elegant architecture with excellent connectivity, making it ideal for families seeking comfort and convenience in a prime city location.\n\nStrategically connected to Vallabhabhai Patel Road, Link Road, Western Express Highway, Lokmanya Tilak Road and major commercial hubs, The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande ensures seamless access to schools, hospitals, shopping destinations, and transport networks. With premium construction quality, strong social infrastructure, and impressive lifestyle appeal, the project stands out as a valuable residential and investment opportunity in Mumbai.\n\n## The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\nThe 3, 4 BHK Flats at The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande are priced from ₹ 3.55 Cr to ₹ 4.98 Cr. 3 BHK: ₹ 3.55 Cr, 4 BHK: ₹ 4.73 Cr provides a detailed breakdown of costs for each configuration. The 4 different configurations offer a range of choices to suit varying needs\n\nThe Oil Bound Distemper, Vitrified Tiles, Premium Bath Fittings, RCC Frame Structure include information about the included amenities. The 1638 Sq.Ft. and 2297 Sq.Ft. of the apartments provide flexible options. Comparatively, the ₹ 35,900 /Sq.Ft. in the surrounding area gives context to the value proposition. Consider that the average asking price of ₹ 31,300 /Sq.Ft. in Borivali West.\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1638 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.55 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1860 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 4.03 Cr** | 