\n\n### Master Plan 1\n\nLiving at This area provides a spacious and green residential experience, where you can enjoy extensive this amenity and well-defined internal this amenity. This project is ideal for those seeking a tranquil home environment with excellent road connectivity in Mumbai's western suburbs. The exceptionally low built-up density ensures a sense of openness and privacy that stands out in this urban setting.\n\nDownload master plan & walkthrough video of The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande to explore layout and virtual tour in Borivali West, Mumbai.\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande\n\nThe Wadhwa Aquaria Grande offers a vibrant lifestyle with access to Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Lift, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Sauna, Party Hall, Normal Park / Central Green. Residents can enjoy a range of facilities designed to enhance their living experience. This development focuses on community living and provides spaces for social interaction and recreation.\n\nThese features cater to all age groups, ensuring a well-rounded lifestyle for families and individuals alike. It is designed to promote a healthy and active lifestyle. This development provides a comfortable and convenient living environment for all residents.\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-sauna-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around The Wadhwa Group Borivali West\n\nThe Wadhwa Aquaria Grande is situated in Borivali West, offering a lifestyle with a livability index of 4.3. The area benefits from a connectivity index of 4.1, ensuring convenient commutes. With pincode 400091, residents find essential services and daily conveniences within easy reach.\n\nThe strategic location provides access to Narayana e-Techno School, Borivali West, V Star Mall, Rajendra Nagar and is well-connected via Vallabhabhai Patel Road, Link Road, Western Express Highway, Lokmanya Tilak Road. This area features an education & healthcare index of 4.4, making it ideal for families. The locality also offers a lifestyle index of 4.3, reflecting its vibrant atmosphere. Additionally, the average rental price for a home like this is STUDIO with price ₹ 22.1 K, 1 BHK with price ₹ 32.7 K, 2 BHK with price ₹ 45.5 K, 3 BHK with price ₹ 74.4 K.\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-wadhwa-aquaria-grande-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Narayana E-techno School\n\n#### Stlawrence High School\n\n#### Shraddha Nursing Home\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Borivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway & SV Road\n\nLimited social amenities and infrastructure\n\nBorivali West attracts me since my experiences feel subdued and balanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande\n\nThe Wadhwa Aquaria Grande is currently Ready to Move, offering 3, 4 BHK Flats. This project is registered with P51800007959, ensuring full compliance and transparency. The expected Dec 2020 marks an important milestone for future residents. The development provides confidence in its adherence to regulatory standards.\n\nThe construction is progressing according to schedule, ensuring timely delivery of homes. With the Aug 2017 already behind us, the focus is now on delivering a high-quality living experience. The possession timeline is strategically planned.\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n2 Sales Transactions Registered in The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 16.6 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-02-26 | Floor 21, Unit 2101 | B | 2,455 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-11-06 | Floor 19, Unit 1901 | A | 2,045 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-09-30 | Floor 19, Unit 1901 | A | 2,045 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande compare with similar projects?\n\n![The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-wadhwa-aquaria-grande-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/the-wadhwa-aquaria-grande/3009/project \"The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Kanakia Spaces Samarpan project in Borivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumba