s ranging from 1638 Sq. Ft. to 2297 Sq. Ft., with prices starting from 3.55 Cr to 4.98 Cr.\n\n### What is the expected completion date of The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande?\n\nThe project is ready to move and has an expected completion date of December 30, 2020.\n\n### Who is the developer of The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande?\n\nThe project is developed by The Wadhwa Group, a reputed real estate developer with a total of 86 projects in its portfolio.\n\n### What are the amenities offered in The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande?\n\nThe project offers a range of amenities, including a gymnasium, power backup, 24x7 security, sauna, and a normal park or central green space.\n\n### Are there any nearby infrastructure developments and growth potential in the area?\n\nThe project is strategically located with proximity to roads such as Vallabhabhai Patel Road, Link Road, Western Express Highway, and Lokmanya Tilak Road, making it an attractive option for those seeking a peaceful yet connected lifestyle.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/project/aquaria-grande-borivali-west/26108","title":"Aquaria Grande, Borivali — resale, rent & RERA | MPE","raw_content":"[![Mumbai Property Exchange](/static/images/logo.png)](/)\n[List Property](/list-property)[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\n[New Projects](/projects-new-homes)[🗺️ Projects Map](/projects-map)[Buy a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/sale/all-locations)[Rent a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/rent/all-locations)[Commercial](/commercial-office-premises/sale/all-locations)[Builders & Developers](/builders)[Why Us](/why-us)[RERA Search](/rera-search)[Localities](/locations)[Tools & Calculators](/tools/budget-planner)[NRI Hub](/nri-hub)[News](/news)[+ List Your Property](/list-property)[💬 WhatsApp Us](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\nMumbai property advisory & dataOperating since 1995✓ MahaRERA A51800043517Source-labelled project dataWe reply in minutes on WhatsApp\n\n![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-main.webp)✓ MahaRERA P51800007959RERA: no litigation reported\n\n# Aquaria Grande\n\nClub Aquaria Enterprises\n\nRegistered MahaRERA name: Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33 - 38\n\n📍 Borivali, Mumbai Suburban · 400091\n\nCertificate Signed\n\n**Completed/historical project — current inventory unconfirmed**\n\nAsk an advisor to check current resale or rental availability.\n\nSource stage: Sold Out · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\nPooja Batra · Senior Advisor\n\nMumbai Property Exchange · MahaRERA-registered since 2017\n\n[📞 Call](tel:+919819311244)[💬 WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=Hi%20MPE%2C%20I%20have%20a%20property%20query)\n\n★\n\n## Gallery\n\n![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-oth-aquaria-grande-elevation-image-1.webp)![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-oth-aquaria-grande-image-0.webp)![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-oth-aquaria-grande-aug-2019.webp)![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-oth-aquaria-grande-sept-2019.webp)![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-oth-aquaria-grande-image-1.webp)![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-oth-aquaria-grande-image-2.webp)![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-oth-aquaria-grande-image-3.webp)![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-oth-aquaria-grande-image-4.webp)![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-oth-aquaria-grande-parking.webp)![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-oth-aquaria-grande-security.webp)![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-oth-aquaria-grande-living-room.webp)![Aquaria Grande, Wing B Floor 33-38 ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/26108/26108-oth-aquaria-grande-master-bedroom.webp)\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\nA home that redefines opulence and luxury. **Aquaria Grande** offers the finest residences at Borivali West, which are bound to leave you awestruck. These majestic apartments come with choicest amenities. The project is so magnificent, that it has become the most iconic landmark in Borivali.\n\n**Hallmarks of Aquaria Grande:**\n\n* 38 Floors Under construction Project.\n* Location is Devidas Rd, Near St. Lawerence High School, LIC Colony, Borivali West and is developed by The Wadhwa Group.\n* **Aquaria Grande was launched in Oct 2017 and the possession of the same is likely to be in Dec 2020**.\n* **Aquaria Grande Wing B (Floor 33-38) is RERA approved has the Registration Number bearing P51800007959.**\n* Attractive architectural elevation\n* **Typology** : 3BHK - 1638 + 175  (1813 sq ft) | 3.5BHK - 1859 + 191 ( 2050 sqft) | 4BHK - 2297 + 199 ( 2496 sqft)\n* Column & Beamless Apartments, with slab to slab height of 3.6 metres.\n* Approximately 12 ft. Of clear floor to ceiling hights\n* Possibility of a duplex apartment with private lift and staircase\n* 3 sides open apartment with wrap around balcony\n* Views mein plz add Pagoda\n* A Divine Pooja room in each apartment\n* Provision for servant's room and separate toilet in each apartment\n* Massive double level designer entrance & lift lobbies\n* 3 Levels of car parking for approx 460 cars.\n* Magnificient views of Borivali National Park & Gorai Beach.\n* Club House with top class recreational facilities.\n* **Aquaria Grande has good reviews and the ratings of this project are approximately 5 out of 5.**\n\n**The property prices in Borivali West** are in the range of 12000 to 15000 for Outright for ready and under construction projects.\n\nThe Wadhwa Group currently has 3 Ready Possession, 9 Under Construction projects.\n\n**You can download the brochure and see video of Aquaria Grande** and you can see the latest digital pictures, Floor Plans, Location Plans & Rate History on our website.   \n The Bookings for the Under Construction project Aquaria Grande are open and we can set up a Site Visit any time at your Convenience.  \n Aquaria Grande is approved by most of the Banks and for more details on the approved bank list, please connect with us.\n\n₹\n\n## Borivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹31,200/sqft\n\nmedian · 29 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹88.7/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.4%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2021\n\nRevised\n\nDec 2021\n\nStatus\n\nOngoing\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n3 BHK1,639 ft²On request\n\n5 BHK Point1,860 ft²On request\n\n4 BHK2,185–2,298 ft²On request\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Aquaria%20Grande%2C%20Wing%20B%20Floor%2033-38%20%20(RERA%20P51800007959))\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nP51800007959\n\nRegistered\n\n2021-09-10\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n