https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125103/Amenities/48787-1737367103.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Sample Apartment of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 207772](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125103/Sample%20Apartment/414-1737367114.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Sample Apartment of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 207773](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125103/Sample%20Apartment/Hou-1737367114.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Sample Apartment of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 207774](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125103/Sample%20Apartment/848-1737367114.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Sample Apartment of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 207775](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125103/Sample%20Apartment/58484-1737367114.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Location of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 207777](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125103/Location/Hou-1737367124.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n## Project Overview of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nNo. of Units\n\n17 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n0.23 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 31 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nWadhwa Aquaria Grande by The Wadhwa Group is a premium residential project located in Borivali West, Mumbai. Designed to provide a sophisticated lifestyle, this development blends modern architecture with thoughtful layouts, offering spacious and elegantly designed residences. Aquaria Grande is a symbol of luxury and comfort, ensuring that every aspect of urban living is enhanced for its residents. Its location in Borivali West places it in proximity to key city conveniences, making it an ideal choice for discerning homeowners.  \n  \nThe project features world-class amenities that cater to the needs of every family member. A well-equipped fitness center, a serene swimming pool, and landscaped gardens provide a perfect balance of recreation and relaxation. For social gatherings, residents can make use of a multi-purpose hall and other community spaces designed to foster interaction and togetherness. Safety and convenience are prioritized with round-the-clock security, ample parking facilities, and efficient maintenance services.  \n  \nStrategically situated in Borivali West, the project offers excellent connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping centers, and entertainment hubs. The neighborhood's lush greenery and vibrant social infrastructure enhance the living experience. Wadhwa Aquaria Grande stands out as an exceptional residential destination, combining elegance, comfort, and convenience to offer an unparalleled urban lifestyle.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Wadhwa Aquaria Grande in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 828420](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125103/BHK_Configuration/3-BHK-1431-1737366958.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nSuper Built-Up\n\n1431 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n3.5 Cr\n\n![3.5 BHK Flat in Wadhwa Aquaria Grande in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 828421](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125103/BHK_Configuration/3.5-BHK-1637-1737367000.webp)\n\n3.5 BHK Flat\n\nSuper Built-Up\n\n1637 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n4 Cr\n\n![4 BHK Flat in Wadhwa Aquaria Grande in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 828422](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125103/BHK_Configuration/4-BHK-2058-1737367025.webp)\n\n4 BHK Flat\n\nSuper Built-Up\n\n2058 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n5 Cr\n\n![Master Plan of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 207781](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125103/Master%20Plan/MP-1737367137.webp)\n\nMaster Plan\n\n![Floor Plan of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 207783](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125103/Floor%20Plan/FP-1737367149.webp)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n## Key Features of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Modern Comfort.\n* Lavish Apartments.\n* Quality Living Spaces.\n* Luxury Living.\n* Meticulously Designed.\n* Comfort And Convenience.\n\n## Amenities Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* 24X7 Water Supply\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Intercom Facility\n* Lift\n* Security\n* Visitor Parking\n* Power Backup\n* Yoga Room\n* Mud Playing Zone\n* Meditation Zone\n* Recycle Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Dth And Broadband Connection\n* Clubhouse\n* Senior Citizen Plaza\n* Society Office\n* Gazebo\n* Open Gym\n* Wooden Pergola\n* Convenience Store\n* Drop-Off Zone\n\n* Swimming Pool\n* Kids Play Area\n* Lattu Game\n* Game Corners\n* Indoor Games\n* Cricket Ground\n* Multipurpose Play Court\n* Jogging Track\n* Gymnasium\n* Carrom\n\n* Reserved Parking\n* Maintenance Staff\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Cctv For Common Areas\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Earthquake-resistant\n* 24/7 Security\n* Fireplace\n* Rcc Structure\n\n* Community Club\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vaastu-Compliant Designs\n* Gym\n* Studio Space For Yoga\n* Nature Walkway\n* Green Wall\n\n* Themed Landscape Garden\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Organic Waste Convertor\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n* Rainwater Harvesting\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Laminate finish doors\n* Water Purifier\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Wash Basin\n* False Ceiling\n* Concealed Electrification\n* TV Point\n* Telephone point\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Wall-hung WC & shower\n* Multi-stranded cables\n* Acrylic Emulsion Paint\n* Concealed Drainage System\n* Plaster\n* Geyser Point\n* Pre Hung Doors\n\n## Google Map Location of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Borivali West\n\n## Locality Overview of Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Borivali West](/location-review/mumbai/borivali-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Borivali West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Borivali West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nWadhwa Aquaria Grande is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800007959](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800007959)\n\nProject: Wadhwa Aquaria Grande\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Borivali West\n\n---\n\n* Karuna Hospital\n* Ashwini Ayurvedic Hopsital\n* Punit Hospital\n* OrthoSquare\n\n* Metro Mall\n* D-Victorian Mall\n* Zoom Plaza mall\n* Growel 101 Mall\n\n* Jinu's Corner\n* Snack Shack\n* Kwality Wall's Frozen Dessert And Ice Cream Shop\n* Tandoor Chai\n\n* Aditya Institute of Management Studies & Research\n* Everest College\n* St Rock’s College\n* St. Lawrence Junior College\n\n![The Wadhwa Group](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/248_1678040164_wadhwa.webp)\n\n## [The Wadhwa Group](/mumbai/sale/builder/the-wadhwa-group-248)\n\nOngoing Projects: 8\n\nCompleted Projects: 27\n\nTotal Projects: 35\n\n---\n\nWith decades of commitment to creating a quality fortune in the form of properties, the Wadhwa Group has an extensive reach in Residential, commercial, and Township segments. In 5 decades of work experience, they have made a stronghold in Mumbai's real estate market and have become a leading group having the confidence of their customers and stakeholders.  \n  \nWith some of the best-awarded Residential and Commercial projects, they ensure that they work religiously towards their vision of being into the top real estate firms. To become the most preferred and trusted firm, along with providing high-end residential and commercial projects, they focus on creating an employee-friendly and professional working environment.  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by The Wadhwa Group](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/the-wadhwa-group-248), [Properties in Pune by The Wadhwa Group](https://houssed.com/pune/sale/builder/the-wadhwa-group-248), [Properties in Navi Mumbai by The Wadhwa Group](https://houssed.com/navi.mumbai/sale/builder/the-wadhwa-group-248)\n\n## FAQ's about Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Borivali West\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Borivali West\n\n* [Apartments in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n* [Studio Apartment in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/property/studio-apartment)\n\n### Explore Projects in Borivali West\n\n* [New Projects in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/possession/new-projects)\n* [Ready To Move Projects in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/possession/ready-to-move)\n\n### Homes by BHK in Borivali West\n\n* [1BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/1bhk)\n* [2BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/2bhk)\n* [3BHK Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats/3bhk)\n* [4+ BHK Homes in Borivali West](/m