ttps://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/65d45f523fbc0da68da0c737/2246e6d8-aafd-4e10-a5f8-f625520506e7_Screenshot2024-02-20140106.png)\n\n[![Transaction](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/65d45f523fbc0da68da0c737/86f48221-b495-466f-8ac2-1d6ff8c304e2_Screenshot2024-02-20140143.png)](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/65d45f523fbc0da68da0c737/86f48221-b495-466f-8ac2-1d6ff8c304e2_Screenshot2024-02-20140143.png)\n\n[![Transaction](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/65d45f523fbc0da68da0c737/386b1ffe-b8fd-427c-81da-6ed478e58ee6_Screenshot2024-02-20140228.png)](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/65d45f523fbc0da68da0c737/386b1ffe-b8fd-427c-81da-6ed478e58ee6_Screenshot2024-02-20140228.png)\n\n###### Flat Configuration\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\nBalcony\n\nEnclosed Balcony\n\nTerrace\n\nDry Area\n\nTotal Carpet Area\n\n* [Unit Details](#stackViewTab)\n\n### 1004\n\nNo of BHK\n\n### 1004\n\nFlat No\n\n### sqft\n\nArea\n\n---\n\nPlease Login to Check Latest Transactions\n\n#### Property Listings of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande\n\nShow only* For Rent\n* For Sale\n\n---\n\n## Property Listing in this Project\n\nBuy Rent\n\nNo data Found\n\nNo data Found\n\n---\n\n# Wadhwa Aquaria Grande – Your Dream Home, Backed by Trusted Financial Partners!\n\nWadhwa Aquaria Grande has become a preferred choice for homebuyers, with numerous flats sold to happy owners. These homeowners have been supported by some of India’s most reliable banks and housing finance companies (HFCs), providing a seamless and secure home loan experience.\n\n## About Wadhwa Aquaria Grande\n\nWadhwa Aquaria Grande is a residential project located in Borivali West, Mumbai, developed by the Wadhwa Group, one of the leading real estate developers in India.\n\nThe project offers affordable apartments with different configurations, including 3, 3.5 & 4 BHK. The average price per square feet of the apartments is Rs 26,000. The apartments are designed to provide a comfortable living experience, with spacious rooms, high-quality finishes, and modern amenities. The area of 3 BHK are in the... Read More\n\nWadhwa Aquaria Grande is a residential project located in Borivali West, Mumbai, developed by the Wadhwa Group, one of the leading real estate developers in India.\n\nThe project offers affordable apartments with different configurations, including 3, 3.5 & 4 BHK. The average price per square feet of the apartments is Rs 26,000. The apartments are designed to provide a comfortable living experience, with spacious rooms, high-quality finishes, and modern amenities. The area of 3 BHK are in the range of 1141 - 1710 sqft. The area of 3.5 BHK are in the range of 1860 - 1957 sqft. The area of 4 BHK are in the range of 2019 - 2498 sqft. A 3 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 3 Crs. A 3.5 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 4.8 Crs. A 4 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 5.2 Crs.\n\nThe prime location of Wadhwa Aquaria Grande is a significant advantage for prospective homebuyers, as it is positioned in one of Mumbai's most desirable neighbourhoods. Borivali West, an already well-developed area, provides excellent connectivity to the rest of the city. The project enjoys close proximity to major roads, railway stations, metro stations, and bus stations, resulting in reduced commuting time for office-goers. Additionally, the neighbourhood offers abundant options for retail shopping and fulfilling daily needs.\n\nOverall, Wadhwa Aquaria Grande is an exceptional residential project that ensures a comfortable living experience for its residents through its top-notch amenities and outstanding location.\n\n---\n\n##### More info about Wadhwa Aquaria Grande\n\n* About Locality\n* About Wadhwa Group\n* Investments\n\nCommuting is effortless thanks to the Western Express Highway, Magathane Metro Station, & the Borivali Railway Station. There are plenty of business centers, healthcare facilities, educational institutions and shopping complexes in the vicinity to ensure a comfortable living:\n\n**Healthcare Facilities**\n\n·       Surbhi Life Care Hospital\n\n·       Lifeline Medicare Hospital\n\n**Educational Institutions**\n\n·       Cambridge School\n\n·       Oxford International School\n\n·       JCBN International School\n\n**Shopping Complexes**\n\n·       Thakur Mall\n\n·       Growel€™s 101 Mall\n\n·       Raghuleela Mall\n\n**Shopping Complexes:**\n\n·       Agora Business Plaza\n\n·       Mahindra & Mahindra\n\n·       Wadhwa Technopark\n\n**Day Outing**\n\n·       Sanjay Gandhi National Park\n\nWadhwa Group is one of the leading real estate development companies in India, with a legacy of over five decades. The company has created several landmark projects in Mumbai and Navi Mumbai. Over the years, Wadhwa Group has built a reputation for excellence, innovation, and sustainability. The residential projects developed by the Wadhwa Group are known for their quality and attention to detail. Their projects are designed to provide residents with the best living experience for years to come.\n\nBorivali West is known for being a prime location for residences as numerous residential complexes are housed there along with many posh and upmarket multi-story buildings. Job opportunities in Borivali are plenty as many companies have their offices in this prominent Mumbai suburb. Whether you want luxury homes or budget apartments, this locality has it all! Moreover, Borivali is excellent when it comes to public commuting thanks to the Western Express Highway, Borivali Railway Station and the Mumbai Rapid Metro opening multiple stations in this area. This is expected to drive property rates upward considerably in the coming years.\n\n![about](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/65d45f523fbc0da68da0c737/2246e6d8-aafd-4e10-a5f8-f625520506e7_Screenshot2024-02-20140106.png)\n\n---\n\n##### Properties\n\n* More properties by Wadhwa Group\n\n[![Wadhwa Evergreen Heights-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/66602eb99208cee938d4cb3f/ff9535e6-b752-4245-a8fe-7a8f9aa8fe67_Screenshot2024-06-14182319.png)\n\n#### Wadhwa Evergreen Heights\n\nKalwa, Thane\n\n1 & 2 BHK Flats\n\n66 L-1.0 Cr](/properties/details/wadhwa-group/kalwa/wadhwa-evergreen-heights/66602eb99208cee938d4cb3f)\n\n[![Wadhwa Samarpan-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/65d4898d3fbc0da68da0c73e/a637933a-8d19-449b-9b12-0b70ca358ebd_samarpan-overview-2.jpg)\n\n#### Wadhwa Samarpan\n\nBandra West, Mumbai\n\n-](/properties/details/wadhwa-group/bandra-west/wadhwa-samarpan/65d4898d3fbc0da68da0c73e)\n\n[![Wadhwa The Nest-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/65d46f433fbc0da68da0c738/19d17084-5a4e-4d39-9dd4-25731f42798d_FRON-VIEW-scaled.jpg)\n\n#### Wadhwa The Nest\n\nAndheri West, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Flats\n\n3.1 Cr-3.7 Cr](/properties/details/wadhwa-group/andheri-west/wadhwa-the-nest/65d46f433fbc0da68da0c738)\n\n[![Wadhwa Regalia-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/64c8d32d01ce5cf169b12f1f/dc62fa88-b30d-43a8-a6e8-8dd568524e31_Screenshot2023-08-20113740.jpg)\n\n#### Wadhwa Regalia\n\nKalyan East, Thane\n\n1 BHK Flats\n\n40 L-40 L](/properties/details/wadhwa-group/kalyan-east/wadhwa-regalia/64c8d32d01ce5cf169b12f1f)\n\n[![Wadhwa Rhodesia-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/64b7e28a01ce5cf169b12bf1/974e673f-f55d-45f3-8f87-e6aa124abb28_Screenshot2023-07-21095211.png)\n\n#### Wadhwa Rhodesia\n\nBhiwandi, Thane\n\n1, 2, 3 & 4 BHK Flats\n\n18 L-59 L](/properties/details/wadhwa-group/bhiwandi/wadhwa-rhodesia/64b7e28a01ce5cf169b12bf1)\n\n[![Wadhwa Florence Pearl-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/64b24d7901ce5cf169b12b0c/d40a182e-93c6-4a90-8052-720663e844a2_Project-Photo-13-Wadhwa-Florence-Pearl-Thane-5075949_433_700.jpg